  "description": "A top-tier security expert who's also sharp as a tack White hacker Baek Dan-Hui. But even she had a problem: On rainy nights, she'd have nightmares and couldn't sleep! Then one day, she accidentally spent the night with Taeju Group's Executive Director Kwon Tae-San, and slept like a baby...? Then, shamelessly, “Executive! I'll just hold your hand and sleep!” \n\nA romantic comedy of healing wounds between a capable man and a capable woman, deeply entangled by one incident.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
